  "room": "S51",
  "notes": "Svantnerova tram stop, 29 October 2020 afternoon (bg_natural/S51.webp, redesigned 2026-10-06): wind in the autumn trees, leaves falling onto the lawn and the road and drifting onto the platform, clouds, the clock's second hand (old brass frame), the orange dots of the LED board shimmering, pigeons on the platform. Every 90 s (first 6 s after entering) an unbranded modern low-floor tram comes over the crest of the rising street, brakes into the stop, waits 10 s and pulls out towards the camera (tram2020_*: one sprite from a paid edit, cut by art/ambient/natural/vehicles/build_s51.py, chain written by layers.py; hidden with reduced motion).",
